    "created_at": "2018-08-01T09:29:54Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-01T09:34:04Z",
    "body": "Thanks for the feedback, and I agree on the need for tests. \r\n\r\nOutside of `pending application cache download process tasks `, I couldn't find another example of a concept currently using the `networking task source` for tasks that might not want to be cancelled as part of document load cancelling.\r\n\r\n(as said, the other example is `EventSource`, which already queues it's non-fetch tasks on a dedicated task source, and there a test for that, I think,  in `tests/wpt/metadata/eventsource/eventsource-request-cancellation.htm.`). \r\n\r\nCan you think of other components that could fit this profile?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
