    "created_at": "2018-08-09T08:30:40Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-08-09T08:30:40Z",
    "body": "Note that we want to remove \"application cache\".\r\n\r\nI actually wonder if browsers remove all the tasks. Some browsers do cancel some fetches (belonging to the badly specified \"fetch group\"), but I expect those to still be able to result in some JavaScript executing.",
